        "product_summary": "Closed-toe summer profile: A covered toe and heel combine with side openings for a casual sandal silhouette.\nPerforated cow-leather upper: Rows of small holes and larger side cutouts define the visible upper design.\nSlip-on opening: The low-cut opening and rear heel loop offer a lace-free dressing option.\nStitched panels and grooved tread: The source photos show stitched upper edges and a segmented outsole pattern.\nAssortment options: Black and Brown, EU 38-44. Plan your wholesale range with a preferred color-size mix.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
